{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"laughs \"It would, but where is the adventure in that?  I'm sorry, I believe I have heard people call you Lilia?\" takes off his hat and bows.  His face shifts features, both masculine and feminine.  \"I am Heki\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T22:49:35.989000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743602183425097870","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Lilia smiles and returns the bow \"It's  a pleasure' Heki.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T22:50:50.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743602496458588260","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"The pleasure is all mine, I assure you\" he says as he replaces the hat atop his head","created_at":"2020-08-13T22:52:17.092000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743602859139924059","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"She begins to start helping around, \"I haven't seen you around town much... however I still haven't meteveryone yet.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T22:52:17.205000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743602859614142534","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Well, You likely have seen me around, but I was on the crew, and like to wear other peoples faces.  I'm not used to being myself, but after all those 'chads' went missing, I decided to not stay with the crew any longer\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T22:53:37.503000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743603196408365086","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I see. That makes sense I suppose.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T22:54:18.822000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743603369712681010","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"he picks finds a few more bottles and puts them in the bar","created_at":"2020-08-13T22:54:24.875000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743603395100934214","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Truth be told, I collect stories.  Its said that memories become legends, legends fade to myth, and even myths become long forgotten eventually.  So I collect all that I can, as to not let them die.  Do you know the difference between memory, legend, and myth?\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T22:56:35.998000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743603945070395551","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Lilia smiles a little excitedly \"I know much about memories, I too collect them but in a different way. I would say a memory is something stored in yourself on in a object that you've left an imprint on. A legend is more removed, like a history of sorts. Myth would be even farther removed from that I believe almost forgotten and hardly believed.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T23:00:08.512000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743604836418977842","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Correct.  Each teller of a memory changes it, alters it, embellishes their favorite parts.  That is the 'removed' part you speak of.  Now how would you like to see physical memories so to speak?\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T23:02:21.073000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743605392419848252","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I would love too.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T23:03:12.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743605608632025140","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Heki pulls out a pipe and begins packing it as he speaks \"Lovely, and you wouldn't mind sharing those memories?  Anyone here will be able to see them.\" he says peering under the brim of his hat.","created_at":"2020-08-13T23:04:26.966000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743605920453623899","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"She thinks for a moment \"There was a time, before I came to this island, I was a servent for a noble woman she often held balls. I would like to see one of those again.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T23:07:28.705000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743606682722107392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
