{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"At this point, this ramshackle bar is assembled.  The 'walls' are a circle of broken material, mostly from the previous pub that was here, but also anything found around town after the fires, flooding, attacks.  Dead kelp is being used to bind much if the structure togeather.  There is a large water proof tarp being used for a ceiling.  Inside the ring are multiple tables that are not in the best condition, but useable, and parts of the old bar and stage now makeup one side of the pub.  Where the old door was, it is just an opening in the ring, using the door as a bridge on the ground, from the Town Square to the inside of the pub itself.  Next to the opening is a painted sign with the following:\n```If you are a dreamer, come in.\nIf you are a dreamer, a wisher, a liar,\nA hope-er, a pray-er, a magic bean buyer . . .\nIf you’re a pretender, come sit by my fire,\nFor we have some flax golden tales to spin.\nCome in!\nCome in!```","created_at":"2020-08-14T13:47:11.199000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743828068547952670","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Heki looks around, and while no one is watching, pours himself a shot and knocks it back.","created_at":"2020-08-14T20:52:29.885000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743935101674717316","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"pulls put a pipe and packs it.","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:05:23.319000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743938345691775086","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Lilia enters the pub","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:08:48.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743939205348196422","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Heki, I came to return your pipe.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:09:07.972000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743939287954882590","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Well hello there.  Oh thank you, did you use it again?\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:09:20.967000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743939342459731988","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I haven't. A lot has been going on so I didn't think to.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:10:08.043000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-14T21:10:35.998000Z","id":"743939539910787262","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Oh, any good stories to tell, I need the details\" his eyes glint with excitement","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:11:08.327000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743939792760471563","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Many of us were in a battle with a devil last night.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:12:31.933000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743940143429451966","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"he sets his pipe in the counter, and pulls out a flute","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:12:39.591000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743940175549300797","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I'd call that exciting.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:12:47.344000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743940208067739748","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"A few brave souls mounted an assault on diabolical demons in the depths for the night\" plays a few notes","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:13:32.772000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-14T21:13:45.532000Z","id":"743940398606713347","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"were there close calls?  narrow escapes?\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:14:42.701000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743940691910197299","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Sir Rigatony was charmed. He was sent by the devil to kill us.... he almost succeeded.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:15:21.471000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743940854523363438","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"plays a quick sharp note.  \"did you win your friend back, and band togeather to defeat the foul demon?\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:16:30.966000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743941146006388838","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Well.. yes we did. I knew he was a good fighter but to see him turn his sword on us.. on me. It was scarier then the devil was.\" She pauses \"We got him back though.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:18:31.363000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743941650988138557","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Smiles \"thank you for the story.  Now I heard you all talking in the square.\" he sets the flute down \"sounds like a dangerous adventure.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:19:54.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743941999371223060","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"She nods \"Danger seems to be drawn to this town.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:20:27.988000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743942140148842626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"so, you are hoping to find a spot where the battle with a god eater will happen, and infuse it with holy energies?\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:21:18.962000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743942353949163551","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"If i understood\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:21:26.987000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743942387608322080","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"She nods, \"Its very important to me that we can find out where it will take place.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:22:15.444000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743942590851842219","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"The ritual will take a day to cast. I'll need people to spend some time protecting me, I won't be able to stop once I start.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:23:23.731000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743942877268410492","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"why not just cast from the protection of a tiny hut spell?\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:23:44.964000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743942966325805127","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"it would only take 3 uses to protect you from nearly anything for 24 hours\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:24:44.135000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743943214506967051","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Do you know it?\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:24:56.115000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743943264754728991","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"When you travel wastelands as much as I do, it pays to know that spell.  Yes, I know its use.  No more than 9 creatures can be inside it when cast\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:25:47.052000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-14T21:26:06.458000Z","id":"743943478399991928","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"pours two drinks and hands one to Lilia","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:26:27.785000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743943649246838815","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"The ritual has several moving parts to it. I'll have to walk the perimeter of the space periodically. But I will also need to spend moments unmoving in the center of the area. I think tiny hut will be of great use to us so long as it doesn't interfere with my casting.\" She takes the drink","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:28:01.011000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743944040264761494","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Well if it helps defeat a godkiller, well worth trying\" takes a drink","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:28:44.668000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743944223375622174","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"speaking of gods, have you heard how they are formed?  at least by the myths?\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:29:18.028000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743944363297603695","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I only know the history of the Raven Queen.\" She grabs at the raven skull Web gave her, \"Others I know little of.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:31:31.995000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743944925196058715","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"well, the myths state that all gods and goddesses were at one point beings such as you and I.\" he thumps his hand on the top of the bar making a beating sound like a heart \"but as they gained power in life, it increased their power in death\" a loud thump, and quiet for just a moment.","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:33:57.336000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743945534800396308","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"They say if you get strong enough in life, your spirit becomes a kind of avatar in the afterlife.  Fiends, devils, celestials, all those beings people sell their souls to, to gain power, are just souls that were strengthened in life, and further through consuming our souls.\" scratches the bar top, like a dog wanting to come in a house \"we sell our souls and make them nearly gods.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:36:27.650000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743946165262876713","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"his face goes still, the features mirror Lilia's as he looks her in the eyes with her own \"Faith of people is what elevates them to godhood from there\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:37:26.890000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-14T21:37:37.996000Z","id":"743946413733576795","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"after a moment, he lets his face go back to shifting.","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:37:55.748000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743946534772670464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Lilia listens nodding and comparing this to what she knows of the Raven Queen rise to divinity.","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:38:00.720000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743946555626749962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I would say you are correct. It's believed that the Raven Queen was an elven queen in the Feywild. A ritual was performed by her people to help her achieve the divine status. However, a group of wizards sought the power for themselves and during the ritual took some of it. Just as she gained such power, the ritual failed. The spell collapsed around her, she was plunged into the Shadowfell. If it wasn’t for the fact that she did achieve the divine spark of a God, she would have died.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:42:07.475000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743947590592364615","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"smiles \"We all have the divine spark.  Our soul.  Our faith strengthens other's spark til they become what we call a god.  Some entities will eat your spark for their own power.  So the question I ask is, how do you starve something that eats souls?\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:45:03.415000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743948328538079326","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"You take the soul away, leave nothing for them to eat. Or you trap them in a soulless world, somewhere where life cannot exist.\" Lilia pauses for a moment, \"I do not think we possess the power to do so however.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:46:39.838000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743948732965322878","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"shrugs \"And if you know what something eats, can you find a poison for its food?\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:47:36.919000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743948972380520538","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"If it eat souls, divine energy. We cannot simply take that away from everyone. I can use spells protect us but to prevent a \"poisoning\" of the soul, I could never do. It would be against the Raven Queens will.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:49:46.201000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743949514628399266","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I'm not saying you have to, but possibly this will give you options to think about.  You seem to have a sharp wit, and a keen mind.  Brute force is unlikely to beat something that eats gods for breakfast.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:51:25.157000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743949929679945809","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Thank you, and I agree. We will need skilled and strong fighters when we face it. However it'll mean nothing if we don't play it smart.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:52:53.822000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743950301568040990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"for every heroic tale that you hear a bard talk about, there are a hundred that the person wasnt a hero, and died.  To come out of this, you need heroes\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:54:25.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743950685158113331","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"We need heros indeed.\" She agrees","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:55:20.109000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743950915140190208","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"So find some.  You are the protagonist in your story.  How would the hero of the tale get from where you are, to victory?  There is always a way.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:56:14.382000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743951142777520161","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
